    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawndemonium</strong> is a turn-based tactical dungeon crawler where chess has gone straight to hell \u2014 literally. You play a cursed pawn cast into the infernal checkerboards, fighting to reclaim your lost soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Survive relentless ambushes from demonic chess pieces.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Plan every move carefully \u2014 your position is your power.<br>\ud83d\udd2e Collect cursed relics and unholy weapons to shift the odds.<br>\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f Descend through procedurally generated boards where every level is more dangerous than the last.<br>\u265f\ufe0f Learn the twisted rules of this damned game where bishops teleport, knights charge through walls, and pawns aren't as weak as they look.<br>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Reach the Pawndemonium... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One pawn. One soul. One chance to master the corrupted game of hell.</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pawndemonium</strong> is a turn-based tactical dungeon crawler where chess has gone straight to hell \u2014 literally. You play a cursed pawn cast into the infernal checkerboards, fighting to reclaim your lost soul.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f Survive relentless ambushes from demonic chess pieces.<br>\ud83e\udde0 Plan every move carefully \u2014 your position is your power.<br>\ud83d\udd2e Collect cursed relics and unholy weapons to shift the odds.<br>\ud83d\udd73\ufe0f Descend through procedurally generated boards where every level is more dangerous than the last.<br>\u265f\ufe0f Learn the twisted rules of this damned game where bishops teleport, knights charge through walls, and pawns aren't as weak as they look.<br>\ud83d\udddd\ufe0f Reach the Pawndemonium... if you can.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>One pawn. One soul. One chance to master the corrupted game of hell.</strong></p>",
    "short_description": "Crawl through the infernal checkerboards. Plan your moves, survive demonic hordes, collect unholy weapons, and descend ever deeper to reclaim your soul \u2014 but beware: in this damned game, the rules of chess have been... corrupted. Can you reach the PAWNDEMONIUM ?",
